<title>USA: Thermo Optek buys Thermo Instrument units.</title>
<headline>Thermo Optek buys Thermo Instrument units.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Optek Corp said on Monday that it has purchased ARL Applied Research Laboratories and VG Elemental from its parent, Thermo Instrument Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Thermo Optek also said it acquired four sales-and-service organizations of these two businesses.</p>
<p>The total purchase price is $68.7 million, which includes $55.2 million in cash and the assumption of $13.5 million in debt, Thermo Optek said.</p>
<p>These companies were originally part of the Scientific Instruments Division of Fisons Plc, acquired by Thermo Instrument in March 1996.</p>
